---
// Hero — Section 1 of homepage
---

<section class="flex min-h-screen items-center">
  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-6 pb-24 pt-36 md:pt-44 lg:pt-48">
    <div class="max-w-4xl">

      <!-- Eyebrow -->
      <p class="mb-7 font-mono text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-muted sm:text-sm">
        Strategic Design Partner · 9 Years Experience
      </p>

      <!-- Headline -->
      <h1 class="mb-8 text-[2.6rem] font-bold leading-[1.08] tracking-tight text-fg sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-[4.25rem]">
        Great design won't save<br class="hidden md:block" />
        a broken business.<br class="hidden md:block" />
        But the right design<br class="hidden md:block" />
        partner might.
      </h1>

      <!-- Subheadline -->
      <p class="mb-10 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted sm:text-xl">
        I'm Herru Adi. I help startups and growing teams figure out what to build,
        how to build it, and why it matters — then I make it real.
      </p>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <a
        href="/contact"
        class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-accent px-7 py-4 text-base font-semibold text-white transition-all duration-200 hover:opacity-90"
      >
        Let's figure it out together
        <span
          aria-hidden="true"
          class="transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-0.5"
        >→</span>
      </a>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
